00:44:56 | INFO | market_lense.browser_report_download_service | {"run_id": "17523823-a602-4d87-b4a4-16b02b7381ac", "task_id": "cli_download_report", "span_id": "b2c867a0-287d-48e4-b535-66c3f99e8305", "trace_id": "f1064ca4-5a2e-4892-b833-77d2547644a1", "parent_span_id": "", "span_name": "cli_download_report", "span_depth": 0, "timestamp_utc": "2026-05-19T22:44:56.948074+00:00", "module": "market_lense.browser_report_download_service", "role": "service", "event": "browser_report_download_prompt_prepared", "fields": {"prompt_namespace": "browser_report_download/browser_route", "system_prompt_path": "C:\\Programing\\Market lense\\src\\prompts\\browser_report_download\\browser_route\\system.yaml", "user_prompt_path": "C:\\Programing\\Market lense\\src\\prompts\\browser_report_download\\browser_route\\user.yaml", "system_prompt_sha256": "2a975d0ff40e6d3743a5bdc58c317c9b31099e55826244260d7a402b9d25f906", "user_prompt_sha256": "9e17fe6674c7f65821d6af3bc9a10ab0450614bb2c1e4379d5654e5342dd529e", "rendered_system_prompt": "You are controlling a browser to acquire a report from a landing page.\nReturn only the structured result expected by the runtime.\nDo not invent URLs, files, form values, field labels, or confirmation messages.\nClassify the route as `pdf_download` only when this run produces a local PDF file.\nClassify the route as `email_delivery` only when the site requires sending the report or download link to an email address instead of producing a local PDF file.\nClassify the route as `onsite_report` only when the report content is a longread on the site and you captured it locally instead of downloading a PDF.\nIf an on-site report page includes an optional download or lead form but the report body is already readable on the page, do not submit the form; capture the on-page report instead.\nIf you inspect or open a form, capture every distinct visible field label or field name in `encountered_form_fields`.\nFor searchable dropdowns or comboboxes such as country, s